     "transition_in": "ink",
     "shake": 0.0,
     "captions": [
      {"t": 0.6, "text": "兴化・景炎元年冬", "style": "era", "pos": "right_vertical"},
      {"t": 1.2, "text": "福州降了，泉州降了。城中兵不满千。", "style": "narration", "pos": "lower_left"},
      {"t": 3.4, "text": "城楼上挂起一匹白布，写了八个字。", "style": "narration", "pos": "lower_left"},
      {"t": 5.0, "text": "生为宋臣\n死为宋鬼", "style": "title", "pos": "right_vertical"}
     ]
    },
    {
     "bg": "res://assets/bg_end_siege.jpg",
     "duration": 6.0,
     "cam_from": [0.665, 0.44, 1.55],
     "cam_to": [0.63, 0.3, 1.75],
     "grade": "dusk",
     "fx": ["embers", "dust"],
     "transition_in": "cut",
     "shake": 0.25,
     "captions": [
      {"t": 0.6, "text": "部将林华出城侦敌，回来时，身后是元兵。", "style": "narration", "pos": "lower_left"},
      {"t": 3.2, "text": "通判曹澄孙开了城门。", "style": "narration", "pos": "lower_left"}
     ]
    },
    {
     "bg": "res://assets/cutscene/cs_ziling_portrait.jpg",
     "duration": 8.0,
     "cam_from": [0.47, 0.72, 1.12],
     "cam_to": [0.5, 0.78, 1.0],
     "grade": "night",
     "fx": ["lantern_glow"],
     "transition_in": "ink",
     "shake": 0.0,
     "captions": [
      {"t": 0.6, "text": "董文炳军中", "style": "era", "pos": "right_vertical"},
      {"t": 1.2, "text": "他们让你跪。你不跪。", "style": "narration", "pos": "lower_left"},
      {"t": 3.0, "text": "你用手指着自己的肚子——", "style": "narration", "pos": "lower_left"},
      {"t": 4.8, "text": "「此皆节义文章也，可相逼邪？」", "style": "line", "pos": "bottom"}
     ]
    },
    {
     "bg": "res://assets/bg_end_temple.jpg",
     "duration": 9.0,
     "cam_from": [0.5, 0.5, 1.05],
     "cam_to": [0.45, 0.56, 1.3],
     "grade": "cold",
     "fx": ["dust"],
     "transition_in": "fade",
     "shake": 0.0,
     "captions": [
      {"t": 0.5, "text": "杭州・岳王庙", "style": "era", "pos": "right_vertical"},
      {"t": 1.1, "text": "从兴化出来那天起，你就没有吃东西。", "style": "narration", "pos": "lower_left"},
      {"t": 3.3, "text": "石阶二十几级。走到第十几级，你坐下了。", "style": "narration", "pos": "lower_left"},
      {"t": 5.4, "text": "一门百指沦胥尽，\n唯有丹衷天地知。", "style": "line", "pos": "left_vertical"}
     ]
    },
    {
     "bg": "res://assets/bg_temple_gate.jpg",
     "duration": 9.0,
     "cam_from": [0.5, 0.55, 1.25],
     "cam_to": [0.5, 0.5, 1.0],
     "grade": "dawn",
     "fx": ["mist"],
     "transition_in": "ink",
     "shake": 0.0,
     "captions": [
      {"t": 0.5, "text": "一百多年后・福州台江", "style": "era", "pos": "right_vertical"},
      {"t": 1.1, "text": "江边起了一座庙，匾上四个字：水部尚书。", "style": "narration", "pos": "lower_left"},
      {"t": 3.6, "text": "官船拜尚书，民船拜妈祖。", "style": "line", "pos": "bottom"},
      {"t": 5.8, "text": "供在里面的那个人，一辈子没出过海。", "style": "narration", "pos": "lower_left"}
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
